---
import GhlFormEmbed from './GhlFormEmbed.astro';
---

<section>
  <div class="wrap estimate-content">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>We're a local crew, not a call center</h2>
      <p>Eden Prairie Gutter Installers is a local crew, run in Eden Prairie, not a call center reading from a script. Fill out the form below for a free estimate or with any question you've got, and a real person from the crew follows up, not a lead-routing system.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="estimate-embed">
      <GhlFormEmbed />
    </div>

    <div class="prose estimate-details">
      <h2>Have a question? Contact us directly</h2>
      <p><strong>Eden Prairie Gutter Installers</strong><br />8929 Aztec Dr<br />Eden Prairie, MN 55347</p>
      <p><a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?saddr=current+location&daddr=8929+Aztec+Dr%0D%0AEden+Prairie%2C+MN+55347">Get Directions</a></p>
      <p><a href="tel:+17633173366">(763) 317-3366</a></p>

      <h2>What to include</h2>
      <p>A rough sense of the problem helps: is water overflowing at one spot every storm, is a section sagging or pulled away from the house, or are you just due for a cleaning? If you know roughly how old the current gutters are, that helps too. If you've got a photo, even a phone snapshot from the ground, it helps us come prepared.</p>

      <h2>Other ways to reach us</h2>
      <p>Eden Prairie Gutter Installers is part of the <a href="https://bigmikesgutters.net/">Big Mike Gutters</a> family of companies. You can also reach the wider Big Mike Gutters team directly through <a href="https://share.google/KOBNd3OKm882RWpbh">their Google Business profile</a> or at <a href="https://bigmikesgutters.net/">bigmikesgutters.net</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .estimate-content {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .estimate-embed {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) auto;
  }

  .estimate-details {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
</style>